701-// Conventional circular restart arrow: a thick ring open across the top
702-// with a solid arrowhead continuing the ring clockwise. The ring band is
703-// stamped as tightly overlapping filled disks along the arc so it renders
704-// as one solid, evenly weighted band. Centered on (x, y).
705-void draw_restart_symbol(SDL_Renderer* r, int x, int y) {
706-    const Color icon{220, 237, 255, 255};
